setrate 1
set wave @waveNumber
jump 5 equal wass 1
op rand rando 10 b
op add rWave rando 10
set wass 1
jump 3 equal storm 1
jump 1 lessThan wave rWave
set timeS @second
control enabled processor1 1 0 0 0
control enabled processor2 1 0 0 0
jump 14 equal timeOff 0
jump 20 greaterThan timeS timeOff
jump 8 equal was 1
wait 0.5
set was 1
op rand rand 150 b
op add timeEnd 200 rand
op add timeOff timeEnd timeS
jump 8 always x false
control enabled processor1 0 0 0 0
control enabled processor2 0 0 0 0
wait 0.001
stop
